  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut potato into fries and place on the lined oven tray. Season with salt and drizzle with olive oil.\n• Toss to coat and bake until tender, 20-25 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69925461212f41a9d46b6f87/step-a3470900.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop cucumber and tomato.\n• Thinly slice brown onion (see ingredients).\n• Drain and rinse black beans.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69925461212f41a9d46b6f87/step-fe3ba010.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook onion, until tender, 4-5 mins. Add black beans, tossing, until softened, 2-3 mins.\n• Reduce heat to medium, add Tex-Mex spice blend and cook until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Stir in the BBQ sauce and water and simmer until slightly reduced, 1-2 mins. Season with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69925461212f41a9d46b6f87/step-8242f620.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a small bowl, combine sriracha (SPICY! Use less if preferred) and the mayonnaise.\n• In a medium bowl, combine tomato, cucumber and a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season.\n• Divide fries between plates. Top with black bean mixture. Sprinkle with Cheddar cheese.\n• Top with tomato salsa. Drizzle with spicy mayo to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69925461212f41a9d46b6f87/step-2cd26930.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
